    <description><![CDATA[
# RawrXD Sovereign

Production-grade AI inference runtime with autonomous capabilities.

## Features

- **Autonomous Operation**: Self-healing, self-optimizing AI runtime
- **Hotpatch MASM**: Zero-downtime kernel updates (2-5ms deployment)
- **Chaos Engineering**: Validated resilience under failure conditions
- **Intelligent Ops**: Predictive analytics and anomaly detection
- **Multi-Platform**: Windows, macOS, Linux support

## Installation

```powershell
choco install rawrxd
```

## Configuration

Edit `%PROGRAMDATA%\RawrXD\config\rawrxd.yaml` after installation.

## Documentation

https://docs.rawrxd.ai
    ]]></description>
